<title>THAILAND: Sri Dhana says operations resumed.</title>
<headline>Sri Dhana says operations resumed.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Dhana Finance Plc said on Monday that it had resumed operations despite a fire which last week gutted a central Bangkok building housing its new offices.</p>
<p>The finance and securities company said it had restarted business from its old offices on Monday.</p>
<p>The fire gutted the 36-storey President Tower last Sunday, killing three workers.</p>
